{"seq":3,"slug":"async-io","title":"异步 IO 与网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/async-io","wordCount":746,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"异步-io-与网络\">异步 IO 与网络</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>异步编程的最大价值体现在 I/O 密集型场景：网络请求、文件读写、数据库查询。Python 生态已有丰富的异步 I/O 库，以 aiohttp（HTTP 客户端/服务器）、asyncpg（PostgreSQL）、aiofiles（文件）为代表，覆盖了绝大多数生产需求。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>I/O 密集场景下，程序大部分时间在等待数据到达。异步的价值就是把&quot;等待&quot;变成&quot;切换去做别的事&quot;，而这一切的前提是<strong>操作必须是非阻塞的</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[发起 I/O 请求] --&gt; B{操作是原生异步?}&#10;  B -- 是 --&gt; C[await 让出控制权&lt;br/&gt;循环去跑其他协程]&#10;  B -- 否, 同步阻塞库 --&gt; D{是 CPU 密集?}&#10;  D -- 是 --&gt; E[ProcessPoolExecutor&lt;br/&gt;绕过 GIL]&#10;  D -- 否, I/O 阻塞 --&gt; F[ThreadPoolExecutor&lt;br/&gt;run_in_executor 桥接]&#10;  C --&gt; G[数据就绪后恢复协程]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[发起 I/O 请求] --&gt; B{操作是原生异步?}\n  B -- 是 --&gt; C[await 让出控制权&lt;br/&gt;循环去跑其他协程]\n  B -- 否, 同步阻塞库 --&gt; D{是 CPU 密集?}\n  D -- 是 --&gt; E[ProcessPoolExecutor&lt;br/&gt;绕过 GIL]\n  D -- 否, I/O 阻塞 --&gt; F[ThreadPoolExecutor&lt;br/&gt;run_in_executor 桥接]\n  C --&gt; G[数据就绪后恢复协程]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>由此引出三条选型原则：优先用原生异步驱动（如 asyncpg），避免把线程池当默认方案；对确实只有同步版本的库（如 PIL、旧版 DB 驱动）用 <code>run_in_executor</code> 桥接；CPU 密集计算必须走进程池绕过 GIL。资源管理上，连接、文件句柄、HTTP 会话都应通过 <code>async with</code> 或全局复用来保证正确关闭与复用。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"aiohttp-异步-http\">aiohttp 异步 HTTP</h2><h3 id=\"客户端请求\">客户端请求</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import aiohttp&#10;import asyncio&#10;&#10;async def fetch(url: str) -&gt; str:&#10;    async with aiohttp.ClientSession() as session:&#10;        async with session.get(url) as response:&#10;            return await response.text()&#10;&#10;async def main():&#10;    urls = [&#10;        &quot;https://httpbin.org/get&quot;,&#10;        &quot;https://httpbin.org/ip&quot;,&#10;        &quot;https://httpbin.org/headers&quot;,&#10;    ]&#10;    tasks = [fetch(url) for url in urls]&#10;    results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks)&#10;    for r in results:&#10;        print(r[:100])&#10;&#10;asyncio.run(main())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aiohttp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aiohttp.ClientSession() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session.get(url) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.text()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    urls </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"https://httpbin.org/get\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"https://httpbin.org/ip\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"https://httpbin.org/headers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tasks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [fetch(url) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> urls]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio.gather(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tasks)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r[:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">asyncio.run(main())</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"复用-clientsession\">复用 ClientSession</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>连接池</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每次创建新 Session</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>❌ 差</td>\n<td>仅测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局复用 Session</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>✅ 好</td>\n<td>长期运行的服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文管理器</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>✅ 好</td>\n<td>脚本或批量任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"httpx-同步-异步双模\">httpx：同步/异步双模</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import httpx&#10;&#10;async def fetch_with_httpx():&#10;    async with httpx.AsyncClient() as client:&#10;        response = await client.get(&quot;https://httpbin.org/get&quot;)&#10;        return response.json()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> httpx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch_with_httpx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> httpx.AsyncClient() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://httpbin.org/get\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.json()</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"aiohttp-vs-httpx\">aiohttp vs httpx</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>aiohttp</th>\n<th>httpx</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>协议支持</td>\n<td>HTTP/1.1</td>\n<td>HTTP/1.1 + HTTP/2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步模式</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 风格</td>\n<td>独立设计</td>\n<td>类似 requests</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WebSocket</td>\n<td>内置支持</td>\n<td>需第三方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>略优</td>\n<td>接近</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"异步数据库驱动\">异步数据库驱动</h2><h3 id=\"asyncpg-postgresql\">asyncpg（PostgreSQL）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import asyncpg&#10;&#10;async def query_users():&#10;    conn = await asyncpg.connect(&quot;postgresql://user:pass@localhost/db&quot;)&#10;    rows = await conn.fetch(&quot;SELECT id, name FROM users WHERE active = $1&quot;, True)&#10;    for row in rows:&#10;        print(row[&quot;id&quot;], row[&quot;name&quot;])&#10;    await conn.close()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncpg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> query_users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    conn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncpg.connect(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"postgresql://user:pass@localhost/db\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rows </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn.fetch(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SELECT id, name FROM users WHERE active = $1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rows:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(row[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], row[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn.close()</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"主流异步数据库驱动\">主流异步数据库驱动</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据库</th>\n<th>异步驱动</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n<td>asyncpg</td>\n<td>C 扩展，极高性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MySQL</td>\n<td>aiomysql</td>\n<td>基于 PyMySQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SQLite</td>\n<td>aiosqlite</td>\n<td>线程池包装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Redis</td>\n<td>redis.asyncio</td>\n<td>官方异步支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MongoDB</td>\n<td>motor</td>\n<td>基于 pymongo 的异步封装</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"异步文件操作\">异步文件操作</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import aiofiles&#10;&#10;async def read_config():&#10;    async with aiofiles.open(&quot;config.yaml&quot;, mode=&quot;r&quot;) as f:&#10;        content = await f.read()&#10;    return content&#10;&#10;async def write_log(message: str):&#10;    async with aiofiles.open(&quot;app.log&quot;, mode=&quot;a&quot;) as f:&#10;        await f.write(f&quot;{message}\\n&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aiofiles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> read_config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aiofiles.open(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"config.yaml\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"r\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        content </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f.read()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> content</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> write_log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(message: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aiofiles.open(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"app.log\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> f.write(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">message</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>aiofiles 通过线程池将同步文件操作包装为异步接口，避免阻塞事件循环。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"异步上下文管理器\">异步上下文管理器</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from contextlib import asynccontextmanager&#10;&#10;@asynccontextmanager&#10;async def db_connection(dsn: str):&#10;    conn = await asyncpg.connect(dsn)&#10;    try:&#10;        yield conn&#10;    finally:&#10;        await conn.close()&#10;&#10;async def main():&#10;    async with db_connection(&quot;postgresql://...&quot;)